{"source":"## Semantics: C5, S1, S4, S5, S6, T1, M0, A1\ngrammar ConformanceSkipLookahead version \"1.0.0\" {\n  ## Whitespace trivia.\n  trivia = 1*\" \"\n  ## A guard that inspects the RAW byte after \"a\": trivia is not injected\n  ## inside a lookahead, so a space there must fail even though the skip\n  ## rule would otherwise consume it.\n  main = \"a\" !\" \" \"c\"\n\n  skip = trivia\n\n  entry main: main\n\n  test main {\n    accept \"ac\"\n    accept \"ac   \"\n    reject \"a c\"\n    reject \"a  c\"\n  }\n}\n","tokens":[{"type":"doc","value":"## Semantics: C5, S1, S4, S5, S6, T1, M0, A1","offset":0},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":44},{"type":"ident","value":"grammar","offset":45},{"type":"ident","value":"ConformanceSkipLookahead","offset":53},{"type":"ident","value":"version","offset":78},{"type":"str","value":"\"1.0.0\"","offset":86},{"type":"punct","value":"{","offset":94},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":95},{"type":"doc","value":"## Whitespace trivia.","offset":98},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":119},{"type":"ident","value":"trivia","offset":122},{"type":"punct","value":"=","offset":129},{"type":"num","value":"1","offset":131},{"type":"punct","value":"*","offset":132},{"type":"str","value":"\" \"","offset":133},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":136},{"type":"doc","value":"## A guard that inspects the RAW byte after \"a\": trivia is not injected","offset":139},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":210},{"type":"doc","value":"## inside a lookahead, so a space there must fail even though the skip","offset":213},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":283},{"type":"doc","value":"## rule would otherwise consume it.","offset":286},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":321},{"type":"ident","value":"main","offset":324},{"type":"punct","value":"=","offset":329},{"type":"str","value":"\"a\"","offset":331},{"type":"punct","value":"!","offset":335},{"type":"str","value":"\" \"","offset":336},{"type":"str","value":"\"c\"","offset":